<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document>
<name>P-1616 Map-Fit v4 (Santa Rosa Sur reconciliation)</name>
<description>ROUGH MATCH v4 (2026-09-05): parcel corner 1 at 14.24949, 122.71935 - the straight
tie-line solution (3,508.83 m N60-30'W of the published Batobalani reference points), which
falls in modern Brgy. SANTA ROSA SUR, Jose Panganiban. Reconciliation: the title's 1963
"Brgy. San Rafael" most plausibly included today's Santa Rosa strip (later carved out), which
is also the Progress Map's own locality ("Sta. Rosa Norte/Sur"). The Manila Vein workings sit
~400 m west of the parcel per the 1:2,000 Progress Map (drawn as the overlay). Estimated
accuracy +/-800 m. FINE-TUNE: in Google Earth Pro drag the overlay until creeks/tunnels/quarry
match the terrain; the green lot rides at the same offset. Verify with DENR reply or a GPS pin
on a monumented corner (8-11).</description>
